stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Starting : a diagram wanted
    Starting --> Serving : HELLO answered
    Serving --> Serving : SVG answered
    Serving --> Idle : 2 s with nothing asked
    Serving --> Dead : killed past a cap
    Dead --> Paused : three in a row
    Dead --> Starting : the next diagram
    Paused --> Idle : 60 s later
    state Serving {
        [*] --> Parsing
        Parsing --> Layout
        Layout --> Writing
        Writing --> [*]
    }
